  "bio": "Dominic Brown, a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Manchester, UK, specializes in the intricate black & gray and realism styles. With around 110,000 followers on Instagram, his captivating work has found a vast audience appreciating his meticulous attention to detail. Whether you're a tattoo enthusiast or a first-timer, you can expect superior workmanship from Dominic. His choice of premium tools, including those from Inkjecta, Kwadron, and Butterluxe underscore his commitment towards the craft.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location:\n\nManchester U.K. 🇬🇧\nTattoosbydombrown@outlook.com\n@charbrowntattoo 💜\nSponsors:\n@rawpigments \n@metrixtattoo \n@fraktaltattoosolutions \n@butterluxe_uk",
